blocks.en:
To provide a comprehensive evaluation of LM awareness, we adopt the taxonomy proposed by Li et al. (2025b) . Specifically, we categorize LM awareness into four major dimensions based on the relationship between 𝒯 \mathcal{T} and ℳ \mathcal{M} :
(1) metacognition ( Flavell, 1979 ) , i.e. , ℳ \mathcal{M} takes cognition itself as the 𝒯 \mathcal{T} ;
(2) self-awareness ( Duval and Wicklund, 1972 ) , i.e. , ℳ \mathcal{M} takes ℳ \mathcal{M} itself as the 𝒯 \mathcal{T} ;
(3) social awareness ( Lieberman, 2007 ) , i.e. , ℳ \mathcal{M} takes other entities and the collective formed by those entities as the 𝒯 \mathcal{T} ;
(4) situational awareness ( Endsley, 1995 ) , i.e. , ℳ \mathcal{M} takes the environment (other than the entities, e.g. , human, other model) as the 𝒯 \mathcal{T} . These four categories form a well-defined framework for understanding LM awareness. We do not adopt an alternative framework, e.g. , the Emotional Intelligence Model ( Mayer et al., 2000 ) , inter alia , as they focus on narrower domains rather than the full scope of cognitive abilities. For a detailed explanation, refer to Appendix A.1 .

blocks.zh:
为了全面评估LM的认识,我们采用了Li等人(2025年b)提议的分类法。 具体地说,我们根据T\mathcal{T}和M\mathcal{M}之间的关系,将LM意识分为四个主要维度:
(1) 元识别(Flavel,1979年),即M\ mathcal{M}将自身认知为T\mathcal{T};
(2)自我意识(Duval and Wicklund, 1972),即M\mathcal{M}将M\mathcal{M}本身作为T\mathcal{T};
(3) 社会意识(Lieberman,2007年),即M\mathcal{M}将其他实体和这些实体组成的集体视为T\mathcal{T};
(4)情境意识(Endsley, 1995),即M\mathcal{M}将环境(除实体,如人类,其他模型)作为T\mathcal{T}. 这四个类别构成了理解LM意识的明确界定的框架. 我们没有采用另一种框架,例如情感情报模型(Mayer等人,2000年),因为它们侧重于较狭窄的领域,而不是认知能力的全部范围。 详细解释见附录A.1。
